{99}{The old gods?  There were many of them, although the names of most of them have been lost to history.  I know a few of them...Shakar was the god of war, Geshtianna the goddess of Love, Bolo the god of thieves.  Few people know anything at all about these things, but I've heard there is a man at the university of Tarant who studies the old gods...he might know more...}{The old gods?  There were many of them, although the names of most of them have been lost to history.  I know a few of them...Shakar was the god of war, Geshtianna the goddess of Love, Bolo the god of thieves.  Few people know anything at all about these things, but I've heard there is a man at the university of Tarant who studies the old gods...he might know more...}{}{}{}{}
