{106}{The god Halcyon is the god of Truth.  We worship him by looking at ourselves and discovering the truth within.  We remove anything that is in conflict with that inner truth.  Truth is different for every man...Halcyon only asks that every man be honest with himself when seeking it.  Then, and only then, can a man's inner Halcyon emerge.  [He bows his head, in respect to his god.]}{The god Halcyon is the god of Truth.  We worship him by looking at ourselves and discovering the truth within.  We remove anything that is in conflict with that inner truth.  Truth is different for every man...Halcyon only asks that every man be honest with himself when seeking it.  Then, and only then, can a man's inner Halcyon emerge.  [He bows his head, in respect to his god.]}{}{}{}{}
