{119}{Well, two centuries ago there was an evil pirate named Stringy Pete.  He was an absolute devil...there isn't an act of malice, debauchery or irreverence that he didn't commit while he sailed the seas of Arcanum.  And then one day he dropped anchor just west of here, and found our small village...}{Well, two centuries ago there was an evil pirate named Stringy Pete.  He was an absolute devil...there isn't an act of malice, debauchery or irreverence that he didn't commit while he sailed the seas of Arcanum.  And then one day he dropped anchor just west of here, and found our small village...}{}{}{}{}
